obutyric acid and acetylcholine.\")\n33737:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33301603\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4042015 \"VIP+/ChAT+ interneuron\")\n33738:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32027647\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4042015 \"VIP/ChAT interneuron\")\n33740:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33301603\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4042015 \"VIP+/ChAT+ cell\")\n33741:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30382198\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32027647\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33301603\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4042015 \"Work in the mouse barrel cortex and somatosensory cortex shows that a VIP-ChAT interneuron is predominantely located in L2/3 and more rarely in the deeper layers of the cortex (Dudai et al., 2021; Dudai et al., 2020). This neuronal type could be transcriptomically distinct as transcriptomic studies have identified VIP neurons expressing ChAT in a whole brain mouse transcriptomic study (Tasic et al., 2018).\")\n33742:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4042015 \"VIP-ChAT interneuron\"@en)\n33771:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042017 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000014419))\n33784:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042018 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002131 obo:UBERON_0001932))\n33785:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042018 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000014419))\n33798:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042019 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002131 obo:UBERON_0002197))\n33800:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042019 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000007479))\n33801:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042019 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000007489))\n33814:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042020 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002131 obo:UBERON_0002197))\n33815:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042020 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000007479))\n33816:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042020 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000007489))\n33843:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4042022 ObjectSom