ssue=3&amp;publication_year=1995&amp;pages=866-875&amp;pmid=7657116&amp;doi=10.1016/0016-5085(95)90396-8&amp;\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Scholar</a>]</li>\n1895:<cite>Wattchow DA, Porter AJ, Brookes SJ, Costa M. The polarity of neurochemically defined myenteric neurons in the human colon. Gastroenterology. 1997;113(2):497–506. doi: 10.1053/gast.1997.v113.pm9247469.</cite> [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1053/gast.1997.v113.pm9247469\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOI</a>] [<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/9247469/\" class=\"usa-link\">PubMed</a>] [<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Gastroenterology&amp;title=The%20polarity%20of%20neurochemically%20defined%20myenteric%20neurons%20in%20the%20human%20colon&amp;author=DA%20Wattchow&amp;author=AJ%20Porter&amp;author=SJ%20Brookes&amp;author=M%20Costa&amp;volume=113&amp;issue=2&amp;publication_year=1997&amp;pages=497-506&amp;pmid=9247469&amp;doi=10.1053/gast.1997.v113.pm9247469&amp;\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Scholar</a>]</li>\n1897:<cite>Weidmann S, Schrödl F, Neuhuber W, Brehmer A. Quantitative estimation of putative primary afferent neurons in the myenteric plexus of human small intestine. Histochem Cell Biol. 2007;128(5):399–407. doi: 10.1007/s00418-007-0335-1.</cite> [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00418-007-0335-1\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOI</a>] [<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17882448/\" class=\"usa-link\">PubMed</a>] [<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Histochem%20Cell%20Biol&amp;title=Quantitative%20estimation%20of%20putative%20primary%20afferent%20neurons%