ty&amp;title=Relationship%20between%20colonic%20motility%20and%20cholinergic%20mechanosensory%20afferent%20synaptic%20input%20to%20mouse%20superior%20mesenteric%20ganglion.&amp;author=S.%20M.%20Miller&amp;author=J.%20H.%20Szurszewski&amp;volume=14&amp;publication_year=2002&amp;pages=339-348&amp;pmid=12213101&amp;doi=10.1046/j.1365-2982.2002.00338.x&amp;\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Scholar</a>]</li>\n1949:<cite>Muller P. A., Matheis F., Schneeberger M., Kerner Z., Jové V., Mucida D. (2020). Microbiota-modulated CART(+) enteric neurons autonomously regulate blood glucose.\n1953:</cite> [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1126/science.abd6176\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOI</a>] [<a href=\"/articles/PMC7886298/\" class=\"usa-link\">PMC free article</a>] [<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32855216/\" class=\"usa-link\">PubMed</a>] [<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Science&amp;title=Microbiota-modulated%20CART(+)%20enteric%20neurons%20autonomously%20regulate%20blood%20glucose.&amp;author=P.%20A.%20Muller&amp;author=F.%20Matheis&amp;author=M.%20Schneeberger&amp;author=Z.%20Kerner&amp;author=V.%20Jov%C3%A9&amp;volume=370&amp;publication_year=2020&amp;pages=314-321&amp;pmid=32855216&amp;doi=10.1126/science.abd6176&amp;\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Scholar</a>]</li>\n1955:<cite>Nagao M., Oka N., Kamo H., Akiguchi I., Kimura J. (1994). Differential localization of lectin binding sites and neuropeptides in human dorsal root ganglia.\n1959:</cite> [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00269164\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOI</a>] [<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.