essed in secretomotor neurons\n3094:neurons in PSVN2 express glutamate decarboxylase 2\n3096:neurons.</p></section><section id=\"S59\"><h5 class=\"pmc_sec_title\">Annotating human interneuron subtype 2</h5>\n3337:PSN, PSVN), we mapped all mouse genes to their human orthologs (using only\n4755:motor neurons in the guinea-pig small intestine.\n4761:cholinergic motor neurones, interneurones and vasomotor neurones in the\n4764:471–481.</cite> [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00327280\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOI</a>] [<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/1715238/\" class=\"usa-link\">PubMed</a>] [<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Cell%20Tissue%20Res&amp;title=Calretinin%20immunoreactivity%20in%20cholinergic%20motor%20neurones,%20interneurones%20and%20vasomotor%20neurones%20in%20the%20guinea-pig%20small%20intestine&amp;author=SJ%20Brookes&amp;author=PA%20Steele&amp;author=M%20Costa&amp;volume=263&amp;publication_year=1991b&amp;pages=471-481&amp;pmid=1715238&amp;doi=10.1007/BF00327280&amp;\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Scholar</a>]</li>\n5041:myenteric plexus and external muscle of the small and large intestine of the\n5044:39–53.</cite> [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s004410050565\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOI</a>] [<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/8601295/\" class=\"usa-link\">PubMed</a>] [<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Cell%20Tissue%20Res&amp;title=Chemical%20coding%20of%20neurons%20in%20the%20myenteric%20plexus%20and%20external%20muscle%20of%20the%20small%20and%20large%20intestine%20of%20the%20mouse&amp;author=Q%20Sang&amp;author=HM%20Young&amp;volume=284&amp;publication_year=1996&amp;pages=39-53&amp;pmid=